# Haven has two parts, and neither needs a .env file in this folder.
#
# 1) The app (client/): public values only, already in client/.env.production.
#    For your own copy, replace them with your Supabase project's values:
#
#      VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project>.supabase.co
#      VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your project's anon / publishable key>
#
#    The anon key is meant to be public: Haven's data lives in a private
#    database schema that only the Edge Function can reach.
#
# 2) The server (supabase/functions/api): set these as Edge Function secrets in
#    the Supabase dashboard (Edge Functions -> Secrets), never in a file here.
#    SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and SUPABASE_DB_URL are provided
#    by Supabase automatically.
#
#    Optional, so calls also work on networks that block direct connections
#    (free Cloudflare TURN, dashboard -> Realtime -> TURN Server):
#
#      CF_TURN_KEY_ID=<Turn Token ID>
#      CF_TURN_API_TOKEN=<API Token>
